{"timestamp": 1779336897.232785, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I found Diana dead in Lower Engine, and Bob, you have a lot of explaining to do. \n\nHere is my exact route and timeline so everyone can follow: I went from Cafeteria to Oxygen, then down to Upper Engine. Around tick 8 and 9, I was in Upper Engine and saw Diana alive. Eve was also there, and Bob walked in from Medbay. \n\nAt tick 9, I saw Bob leave Upper Engine and head straight down into Lower Engine. I went down to Lower Engine shortly after, and at tick 12, I walked in to find Diana's body with Bob standing right there next to it. \n\nEve, you were in Upper Engine with us, so you can vouch that Bob was there and headed south. Bob is my primary suspect right now given he was alone with the body and I watched him follow that path. I'm first to speak so I'll listen to what Bob has to say before I lock in a vote, but everyone needs to look hard at Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779336909.94015, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Frank is telling the truth, I can completely vouch for his timeline. \n\nI was in Upper Engine at tick 9, and I saw both Frank and Diana there. Diana was definitely still alive. I can also confirm that I saw Bob leave Upper Engine and head straight south towards Lower Engine right at tick 9. \n\nAfter I saw that, I moved over to Medbay to do my tasks. Alice, you can vouch for me because I was in Medbay with you starting at tick 11, and Charlie, you just walked in at tick 12 right before Frank reported the body. \n\nSince I can perfectly corroborate Frank's story about Bob heading down to Lower Engine where the body was just found, Bob looks incredibly guilty. I'll wait to hear Bob's defense, but right now my vote is definitely leaning that way. Alice, Charlie, you guys are clear from my perspective."}}
{"timestamp": 1779336921.0129848, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can confirm the last part of Eve's story\u2014I spent almost the entire round on the right side of the ship, mostly around Security, Weapons, and Electrical. Early on around ticks 3 to 5, I saw Alice doing tasks in Weapons. I only just walked into Medbay at tick 12 right as the meeting was called, and I did see both Alice and Eve there. \n\nSince there is only one Duck in this game, the fact that Frank and Eve are completely corroborating each other's stories about Upper Engine makes this a pretty open-and-shut case. They can't both be lying Ducks. Bob being alone with the body right after following Diana down to Lower Engine is basically a smoking gun. I'm definitely voting for Bob today."}}
{"timestamp": 1779336941.0838423, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Hold on, everyone! Eve, your timeline is 100% correct, I am not disputing it at all. I did leave Upper Engine at T9 to go down to Lower Engine to work on my Fuel Engines task. But Frank is completely lying about what happened next to frame me. \n\nHere is the actual truth: I was already down in Lower Engine working on my task when Diana walked in at tick 11. Literally one tick later, at tick 12, Frank came into the room right behind her, killed her right in front of me, and instantly self-reported before I could even hit the report button myself! \n\nCharlie, your logic about there being only one Duck is correct, but Eve doesn't have to be a Duck for Frank's story to be a lie! Eve is just an innocent Goose who saw us in Upper Engine, and Frank is using her truthful testimony to make his self-report frame job look bulletproof. Frank followed Diana down, killed her, and pinned it on the guy who was already in the room. Please, think about this logically. Vote Frank, he is the Duck!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779336961.903593, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I can completely confirm both Charlie and Eve's stories. Charlie and I were in Weapons together around ticks 4 and 5, and Eve walked into Medbay from Upper Engine right at tick 11, exactly as she said. The three of us are absolutely clear, which confirms this is a pure 1v1 between Frank and Bob.\n\nBob brings up a very good point: Eve's testimony only confirms the timeline, not who actually swung the knife. Frank could have easily followed Diana down to Lower Engine, killed her, and immediately self-reported to frame Bob, knowing Bob was already down there. It's a classic setup. On the flip side, Bob could just be a Duck who got caught red-handed by Frank.\n\nSince there are 5 of us alive and only 1 Duck left, we have the numbers to safely take a 50/50 guess. Since Charlie and Eve are both leaning toward Bob, I think we should just vote Bob today. If the game doesn't end, we know 100% that Frank is the Duck and we vote him out at the next meeting. \n\nVote Bob today."}}
